    <data key="d0">Arc Publishing Web Rendering Architecture at Washington Post</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing public web rendering flow and internal newsroom/developer template management using ECS, Lambda, DynamoDB, S3, and ElastiCache.</data>
    <data key="d3" />
